<refentry id="cvar.g_misc">

<refmeta>
    <refentrytitle>g_misc</refentrytitle>
    <manvolnum>cvar</manvolnum>
</refmeta>

<refnamediv>
    <refname>g_misc</refname>
    <refpurpose>set various bitflags</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
    <cmdsynopsis>
        <command>g_misc</command>
        <arg><replaceable>flags</replaceable></arg>
    </cmdsynopsis>

<table id="cvar.g_misc.flags" frame="all">
<title>g_misc Flags</title>
<tgroup cols="2" align="left" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
    <colspec colnum="1" colwidth="9*" align="center"/>
    <colspec colnum="2" colwidth="91*"/>
    <thead>
        <row>
            <entry>FLAG</entry>
            <entry>DESCRIPTION</entry>
        </row>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <row>
            <entry>1</entry>
            <entry>Don't let teammates disarm dynamite near objective (only the dynamite owner can disarm it, and enemies, of course...)</entry>
        </row>
        <row>
            <entry>2</entry>
            <entry>binoc-war - enables binocular pickup stats</entry>
        </row>
        <row>
            <entry>4</entry>
            <entry>only admins (admin level 1 or higher) can connect to server</entry>
        </row>
        <row>
            <entry>8</entry>
            <entry>players can throw health/ammo packs vertically</entry>
        </row>
        <row>
            <entry>16</entry>
            <entry>unused</entry>
        </row>
        <row>
            <entry>32</entry>
            <entry>level-4 battle-sense revivees get full health</entry>
        </row>
        <row>
            <entry>64</entry>
            <entry>more realistic weapons aim-spread, factoring player crouch/prone, slick-surfaces and water</entry>
        </row>
        <row>
            <entry>256</entry>
            <entry>Do not give XP to players who kill someone who has been inactive for more than 30 seconds</entry>
        </row>
        <row>
            <entry>512</entry>
            <entry>Do not give XP for med packs</entry>
        </row>
        <row>
            <entry>1024</entry>
            <entry>Do not give XP for ammo packs</entry>
        </row>
        <row>
            <entry>2048</entry>
            <entry>Visible enemy landmines (Battle sense level 4) will be transparent red/blue instead of the usual transparent white texture</entry>
        </row>
        <row>
            <entry>4096</entry>
            <entry>Enable realistic lean animation (Attention this will be forced if g_weapons flag 8 is enabled!)</entry>
        </row>
        <row>
            <entry>8192</entry>
            <entry>Players who drown can't be revived</entry>
        </row>
    </tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Default</title>
    <cmdsynopsis>
        <command>g_misc</command>
        <arg choice="plain"><literal>0</literal></arg>
    </cmdsynopsis>
</refsection>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>
    <command>g_misc</command>
    sets various bitflags for miscellaneous game options.
</para>
</refsection>

</refentry>
